# Data Dictionary

## Dataset Overview

The dataset contains simulation-based solar energy records for five major cities in Saudi Arabia during 2024.

The dataset includes meteorological, geographic, solar panel configuration, and energy generation attributes used for exploratory analysis and solar PV forecasting.

## Column Details

| Field | Type | Description | Unit / Example |
|---|---|---|---|
| Date | Date | Date of the observation | YYYY-MM-DD |
| City | String | Saudi Arabian city | Riyadh |
| Latitude | Float | Geographic latitude | 24.7136 |
| Longitude | Float | Geographic longitude | 46.6753 |
| Temperature (°C) | Float | Daily ambient temperature | °C |
| Weather | String | Weather condition | Sunny |
| Panel Type | String | Solar panel technology | Monocrystalline |
| Mount Type | String | Installation configuration | Rooftop |
| Tilt (°) | Integer | Panel tilt angle | 25 |
| Panel Efficiency (%) | Float | Panel efficiency rating | % |
| Solar Irradiance (kWh/m²/day) | Float | Daily solar irradiance | kWh/m²/day |
| Output Power (W) | Float | Peak output power | W |
| Estimated Daily Output (kWh) | Float | Estimated daily energy generation | kWh |

