## Important Notes

- The dataset covers the year 2024.
- The dataset is simulation-based rather than directly measured PV sensor data.
- Panel efficiency is included as a configuration feature, but it does not meaningfully differentiate the simulated daily output.
- The three panel technologies show statistically similar output distributions in the analysed dataset.
- The dataset is used for Big Data processing, exploratory analysis, feature engineering, and solar PV forecasting.

